        "text_xAWnhF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-0",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-0",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "95ch",
            "richtext": "<p>To help reduce the risks of airborne transmission, The EPA recommends positioning your air purifier for viruses with a clear path to each person in the room. This ensures clean air can reach each person in the space.⁵ <\/p>",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
        "text_bXDxMw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-0",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-0",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "95ch",
            "richtext": "<h5>24\/7 protection against viruses and bacteria<\/h5><p>While all Blueair purifiers feature HEPASilent™ filtration technology to efficiently remove 99.97% of airborne virus and bacteria particles, only our Protect air purifiers provide 24\/7 protection against viruses and bacteria with GermShield technology.⁶ <\/p><h4>protect kills germs and prevents growth with GermShield technology.<\/h4><p>Even when Protect is on standby, the patent pending GermShield technology proactively monitors room conditions and kills viruses and bacteria on the filters using low air draft and plasma charging. A gentle stream of air then ensures no new growth of germs.⁷ <strong>Learn more about Protect and shop our best air purifiers for viruses and bacteria.  <\/strong><\/p>",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        }
      },
